{"path": "repos/lablab-ai/community-content/pulls/1088", "status": 200, "data": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/lablab-ai/community-content/pulls/1088", "id": 4672900245, "node_id": "PR_kwDOJcIRwc8AAAABFobMlQ", "html_url": "https://github.com/lablab-ai/community-content/pull/1088", "diff_url": "https://github.com/lablab-ai/community-content/pull/1088.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/lablab-ai/community-content/pull/1088.patch", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/lablab-ai/community-content/issues/1088", "number": 1088, "state": "open", "locked": false, "title": "docs(tutorials): add comprehensive tutorial for Vectara Chat (#462)", "user": {"login": "sergioprica", "id": 79606984, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjc5NjA2OTg0", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79606984?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/sergioprica", "html_url": "https://github.com/sergioprica", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sergioprica/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sergioprica/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sergioprica/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sergioprica/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sergioprica/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sergioprica/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sergioprica/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sergioprica/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sergioprica/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "Closes #462\n/claim #462\n\n## Summary\nAdds a comprehensive, original developer tutorial for **Vectara Chat** (`tutorials/en/crafting-a-comprehensive-tutorial-for-vectara-chat.mdx`) following all requirements in #462 and the [lablab.ai Tutorial Guidelines](https://github.com/lablab-ai/community-content/blob/main/tutorials/README.md).\n\n### Sections Covered\n- **Introduction to Vectara Chat**: Grounded Generation architecture, native multi-turn conversational memory (`conversationId` / `turnId`), and comparison against stateless RAG pipelines.\n- **Getting Started with Vectara Chat**: Workspace & corpus setup, metadata filter attributes, environment setup, and Python document indexing script (`/v1/index`).\n- **Building a Chatbot with Vectara**: Complete `VectaraChatClient` implementation with multi-turn session persistence, context window configuration, and inline citation extraction (`/v1/query`).\n- **Enhancing Chatbot Intelligence**: Hybrid search lexical interpolation (`lambda`), Maximal Marginal Relevance (`rerankerId: 272725718`, `diversityBias`), and hallucination detection via the Hughes Hallucination Evaluation Model (HHEM) / Factual Consistency Score (`factualConsistencyScore: True`).\n- **Deploying and Testing Chatbots**: Interactive **Streamlit** application with live retrieval/grounding controls plus an automated multi-turn & FCS smoke test suite.\n- **Conclusion and Tips for Hackathon Participants on Use Cases for the Models**: Practical advice for lablab.ai hackathon teams and links to both required Vectara tutorials ([Vectara Beginner App Tutorial](https://lablab.ai/t/vectara-beginner-app-tutorial-showcase-the-creation-of-vectara-app-in-legal-use-case) and [Vectara Advanced App Tutorial](https://lablab.ai/t/vectara-advanced-app-tutorial-showcase-the-creation-of-vectara-app-in-legal-or-customer-support-use-case)).\n", "created_at": "2026-09-29T05:20:18Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-29T05:20:18Z", "closed_at": null, "merged_at": null, "merge_commit_sha": "aec10a25b669ab846feaf90773cd46d9ffdeb35b", "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "labels": [], "milestone": null, "draft": false, "commits_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/lablab-ai/community-content/pulls/1088/commits", "review_comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/lablab-